    },
    {
      "text": "Spray a light coat of nonstick spray onto a microwave safe plate. Place the tablespoons of parmesan cheese into 3 mounds on the plate. Microwave plate of cheese mounds until crisp. Remove plate of cheese mounds from microwave and allow to cool.",
